  ('1522 Series 8mm ID Spacer (10mm OD, 8mm Length) - 4 Pack', '1522-0010-0080', 'This 8mm length, 10mm OD spacer is able to slip over an 8mm shaft—whether that''s a round shaft, REX™ shaft, threaded rod, or even a lead screw—to create space between components. When you run it against a bearing, the spacer will only contact the bearing''s inner race. This allows your project to rotate smoothly.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1522-series-8mm-id-spacer-10mm-od-8mm-length-4-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2258/images/13358/1522-0010-0080__92876__20001.1726494676.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Standoffs & Spacers / Spacers / 8mm ID x 10mm OD Spacers', 'gobilda'),
  ('1522 Series 8mm ID Spacer (10mm OD, 9mm Length) - 4 Pack', '1522-0010-0090', 'This 9mm length, 10mm OD spacer is able to slip over an 8mm shaft—whether that''s a round shaft, REX™ shaft, threaded rod, or even a lead screw—to create space between components. When you run it against a bearing, the spacer will only contact the bearing''s inner race. This allows your project to rotate smoothly.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1522-series-8mm-id-spacer-10mm-od-9mm-length-4-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2223/images/12698/1522-0010-0090__89744__09872.1720724888.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Standoffs & Spacers / Spacers / 8mm ID x 10mm OD Spacers', 'gobilda'),
  ('1522 Series 8mm ID Spacer (10mm OD, 12mm Length) - 4 Pack', '1522-0010-0120', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1522-series-8mm-id-spacer-10mm-od-12mm-length-4-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1781/images/9447/1522-0010-0120__71223__20651.1701993787.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Standoffs & Spacers / Spacers / 8mm ID x 10mm OD Spacers', 'gobilda'),
  ('1523 Series Stainless Steel M4 x 0.7mm Standoff (8mm Diameter, 43mm Length)', '1523-0008-0430', 'This 43mm Length, 8mm OD Steel Standoff is a stout way to join two components or tie together the sidewalls of 1120 Series U-Channel. It comes with two E-clips that you can clip onto any of its several E-clip groove locations to axially constrain 8mm bore bearings.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1523-series-stainless-steel-m4-x-0-7mm-standoff-8mm-diameter-43mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2086/images/11418/1523-0008-0430_Ang3__42928__49664__83907__65312.1710444628.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Standoffs & Spacers / M4 Standoffs', 'gobilda'),
  ('1524 Series Arc-Slot Tensioner Bracket', '1524-0001-0001', 'This tensioner bracket is excellent for taking up that extra bit of slack when working with round belts, timing belts or chains. The slot is 8mm away from the point of rotation so that you can insert the included screws through holes spaced 8mm apart, rotate the bracket to the desired location and lock it down. The 6mm diameter protrusion will allow you to choose from a number of acetal idler options.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1524-series-arc-slot-tensioner-bracket/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1597/images/8391/1524-0001-0001_Ang2__16160__51270.1701993449.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Sprockets & Chain', 'gobilda'),
  ('Ball-Bearing Idler Arm (for 2mm Pitch GT2, 6mm Width Belt)', '1524-0001-0002', 'Belt tension and belt routing are key ingredients for a successful timing-belt linear-motion mechanism. As such, you can fasten this Fixed Tensioner Post—a ball-bearing idler arm—to any two 4mm holes spaced 16mm apart to get a pair of post-mounted bearings that keep your belt in the right path! While capable of multiple use-cases for timing-belt guidance, this Post shines most when mounted near the drive pulley to help prevent unwanted slack from causing the belt to slip off the teeth of the…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/ball-bearing-idler-arm-for-2mm-pitch-gt2-6mm-width-belt/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2489/images/16501/Ang1__27303.1776457283.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Timing Belts & Pulleys / 2mm GT2 Timing Belt Accessories', 'gobilda'),
  ('1526 Series 32mm OD Plastic Pattern Spacer (10mm Length) - 2 Pack', '1526-0032-0100', 'This Plastic Pattern Spacer has an overall length of 10mm, the same as the thickness of two 1611 Series Flanged Bearings, so that a bearing can be inserted into each side and meet in the middle. For this reason you can tighten the assembly down with a bolt passing through the bearing bores without causing axial pressure to be applied to the inner races, leaving you with an extremely smooth and solid rotating Pattern Spacer. The spacer then has holes on the 16mm pattern so you can fasten a…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1526-series-32mm-od-plastic-pattern-spacer-10mm-length-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1660/images/8683/1526-0032-0100__16537__65003.1701993546.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Pattern Spacers', 'gobilda'),
  ('8mm ID Steel Spacer (12mm OD, 10mm Length) - 4 Pack', '1529-0012-0100', 'This 10mm Length Steel Spacer brings fantastic structural strength to your heavy-duty build! The 8mm ID makes it a great match for an 8mm shaft, an 8mm REX® shaft, or an M8 bolt to create space between components or add rigidity when your project requires robustness. The hefty wall thickness provides additional surface area when it''s sandwiched between plates, compared to the similar, but thinner-walled, spacer of the same length in our 1522 Series Spacers. Shafting This spacer can slide onto…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/8mm-id-steel-spacer-12mm-od-10mm-length-4-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2497/images/16238/1529-0012-0100__82917.1773347690.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Standoffs & Spacers / Spacers / 8mm ID x 12mm OD Spacers', 'gobilda'),
  ('8mm ID Steel Spacer (12mm OD, 30mm Length) - 4 Pack', '1529-0012-0300', 'This 30mm Length Steel Spacer brings fantastic structural strength to your heavy-duty build! The 8mm ID makes it a great match for an 8mm shaft, an 8mm REX® shaft, or an M8 bolt to create space between components or add rigidity when your project requires robustness. The hefty wall thickness provides additional surface area when it''s sandwiched between plates, compared to the similar, but thinner-walled, spacer of the same length in our 1522 Series Spacers. Shafting This spacer can slide onto…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/8mm-id-steel-spacer-12mm-od-30mm-length-4-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2496/images/16235/1529-0012-0300__51444.1773347348.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Standoffs & Spacers / Spacers / 8mm ID x 12mm OD Spacers', 'gobilda'),
  ('8mm ID Steel Spacer (12mm OD, 43mm Length) - 4 Pack', '1529-0012-0430', 'This 43mm Length Steel Spacer brings fantastic structural strength to your heavy-duty builds! The 8mm ID makes it a great match for an 8mm shaft, an 8mm REX® shaft, or an M8 bolt to create space between components or add rigidity when your project requires robustness. Importantly, this spacer''s 43mm length matches the inside width of goBILDA® 1120 Series U-Channel, which is the core structural component of the goBILDA® build system. To that end, this spacer''s 43mm width matches that of many…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/8mm-id-steel-spacer-12mm-od-43mm-length-4-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2493/images/16229/1529-0012-0430__30862.1773346159.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Standoffs & Spacers / Spacers / 8mm ID x 12mm OD Spacers', 'gobilda'),
  ('8mm ID Steel Spacer (12mm OD, 48mm Length) - 4 Pack', '1529-0012-0480', 'This 48mm Length Steel Spacer brings fantastic structural strength to your heavy-duty builds! The 8mm ID makes it a great match for an 8mm shaft, an 8mm REX® shaft, or an M8 bolt to create space between components or add rigidity when your project requires robustness. Importantly, this spacer''s 48mm length matches the outside width of goBILDA® 1120 Series U-Channel, and can thereby help to space two plates 48mm apart in such a way as to allow 1120 Series U-Channel to fit perfectly between…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/8mm-id-steel-spacer-12mm-od-48mm-length-4-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2491/images/16222/1529-0012-0480__22224.1773341326.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Standoffs & Spacers / Spacers / 8mm ID x 12mm OD Spacers', 'gobilda'),
  ('4mm ID Aluminum Spacer (8mm OD, 30mm Length) - 4 Pack', '1530-0008-0300', 'This 30mm Length, 4mm ID Aluminum Spacer is a lightweight structural solution that can slip over an M4 screw to create space between components. In comparison to the 6mm OD of a 1502 Series Spacer, the 8mm OD of this spacer creates a larger footprint for greater stability.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/4mm-id-aluminum-spacer-8mm-od-30mm-length-4-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2089/images/11429/1530-0008-0300__98246__50640__51870.1710450895.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Standoffs & Spacers / Spacers / 4mm ID x 8mm OD Spacers', 'gobilda'),
  ('4mm ID Aluminum Spacer (8mm OD, 43mm Length) - 4 Pack', '1530-0008-0430', 'This 43mm Length, 4mm ID Aluminum Spacer is a lightweight structural solution that can slip over an M4 screw to create space between components. In comparison to the 6mm OD of a 1502 Series Spacer, the 8mm OD of this spacer creates a larger footprint for greater stability. The 43mm length of this spacer allows it to fit just right within 1120 and 1121 Series U-Channel and provide rigidity to your structure.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/4mm-id-aluminum-spacer-8mm-od-43mm-length-4-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2090/images/11432/1530-0008-0430__13819__74872__94162.1710450896.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Standoffs & Spacers / Spacers / 4mm ID x 8mm OD Spacers', 'gobilda'),
  ('Steel Pattern Spacer (14mm Bore, 32mm OD, 2mm Thickness) - 2 Pack', '1531-0032-0020', 'This 2mm thick Steel Pattern Spacer is a perfect way to provide a structural offset, as well as spread out the acute forces of tightening screws on plastic components. Even though it''s a simple component, these micro proficiencies can make a macro difference in the success of your build!', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/steel-pattern-spacer-14mm-bore-32mm-od-2mm-thickness-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2269/images/13426/Ang1__51210__19199.1727900458.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Pattern Spacers', 'gobilda'),
  ('4mm ID Non-Flanged Ball Bearing (10mm OD, 4mm Thickness) - 2 Pack', '1600-0410-0004', 'This 4mm ID x 10mm OD bearing is often times used in linear motion assemblies, by mounting multiple bearings in a line to support a movable stage or suspend a dolly. The 4mm ID allows you to fasten the bearing using M4 hardware.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/4mm-id-non-flanged-ball-bearing-10mm-od-4mm-thickness-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1320/images/6504/1600-0410-0004__56264__64639.1701992871.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Bearings / Non-Flanged Ball Bearings', 'gobilda'),
  ('4mm ID Non-Flanged Ball Bearing (16mm OD, 4mm Thickness) - 2 Pack', '1600-0416-0004', 'These non-flanged bearings are able to mount on either side of a structural component that has a width that is divisible by eight, while staying on pattern, to create a linear motion setup. For example, these bearings are able to be placed on the top and bottom sides of the 1120 Series U-Channel, and mounted 64mm from one(1) another. The bearings will provide support to the channel, while allowing it to roll easily to create smooth linear motion. Given the 4mm bore, they are able to be fastened…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/4mm-id-non-flanged-ball-bearing-16mm-od-4mm-thickness-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1078/images/5291/1600-0416-0004__91031__12358.1701992489.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Bearings / Non-Flanged Ball Bearings', 'gobilda'),
  ('6mm ID Non-Flanged Ball Bearing (16mm OD, 4mm Thickness) - 2 Pack', '1600-0416-0006', 'These non-flanged bearings are easy to use while building ''on grid'' given they have a 16mm OD. You can use them as rollers on parts that have a dimension divisible by eight. The 6mm bore makes them compatible with any component with a 6mm OD (6mm D-Shaft, Round Shaft, Spacers, Standoffs, etc.)', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/6mm-id-non-flanged-ball-bearing-16mm-od-4mm-thickness-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1091/images/5422/1600-0416-0006__56731__67796.1701992526.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Bearings / Non-Flanged Ball Bearings', 'gobilda'),
  ('1600 Series Non-Flanged Ball Bearing (8mm ID x 22mm OD, 7mm Thickness) - 2 Pack', '1600-0722-0008', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1600-series-non-flanged-ball-bearing-8mm-id-x-22mm-od-7mm-thickness-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/851/images/4667/1600-0722-0008__38670__26629.1701992263.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Bearings / Non-Flanged Ball Bearings', 'gobilda'),
  ('4mm ID Flanged Ball Bearing (14mm OD, 5mm Thickness) - 2 Pack', '1601-0014-0004', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/4mm-id-flanged-ball-bearing-14mm-od-5mm-thickness-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/333/images/2540/1601-0014-0004__63979__08083.1701991623.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Bearings / Flanged Ball Bearings', 'gobilda'),
  ('5mm ID Flanged Ball Bearing (14mm OD, 5mm Thickness) - 2 Pack', '1601-0014-0005', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/5mm-id-flanged-ball-bearing-14mm-od-5mm-thickness-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/335/images/2545/1601-0014-0005__04462__56568.1701991624.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Bearings / Flanged Ball Bearings', 'gobilda'),
  ('1601 Series Flanged Ball Bearing (6mm ID x 14mm OD, 5mm Thickness) - 2 Pack', '1601-0014-0006', 'This bearing has been replaced by 1611 Series Flanged Ball Bearing (6mm ID x 14mm OD, 5mm Thickness) - 2 Pack.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1601-series-flanged-ball-bearing-6mm-id-x-14mm-od-5mm-thickness-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/337/images/2551/1601-0014-0006__86835__84940.1701991626.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('1601 Series Flanged Ball Bearing (8mm ID x 14mm OD, 4mm Thickness) - 2 Pack', '1601-0014-0008', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1601-series-flanged-ball-bearing-8mm-id-x-14mm-od-4mm-thickness-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/339/images/2557/1601-0014-0008__48678__48211.1701991627.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('32mm ID Flanged Ball Bearing (39mm OD, 5mm Thickness)', '1601-0039-0032', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/32mm-id-flanged-ball-bearing-39mm-od-5mm-thickness/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/341/images/2562/1601-0039-0032__24558__22141.1701991629.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Bearings / Flanged Ball Bearings', 'gobilda'),
  ('6mm ID Flanged Ball Bearing (12mm OD, 4mm Thickness) - 2 Pack', '1601-0412-0006', 'This 12mm OD Flanged Ball Bearing has a 6mm ID for supporting the rotation of 6mm round or D-profile shafting. Within the goBILDA® system, it''s a great way to create a dead wheel setup with the 32mm Diameter Omni Wheel (SKU: 3624-4008-0032) and a 6mm OD component--such as 6mm OD standoffs, or 6mm round or D-profile shafting.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/6mm-id-flanged-ball-bearing-12mm-od-4mm-thickness-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2277/images/13491/Ang1__39899__59314.1728589625.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Bearings / Flanged Ball Bearings', 'gobilda'),
  ('12mm ID Flanged Ball Bearing (32mm OD, 10mm Thickness)', '1601-1032-0012', 'This 12mm bearing is able to add radial support to a 12mm OD shaft or tube. Though it has a round bore, this bearing is commonly paired with REX shafting as they are a match-fit. The 32mm OD allows this bearing to mount in a 32mm clamping mount.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/12mm-id-flanged-ball-bearing-32mm-od-10mm-thickness/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1155/images/5767/1601-1032-0012-Ang-2__02941__62430.1701992641.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Bearings / Flanged Ball Bearings', 'gobilda'),
  ('4mm Bore 1-Side, 2-Post Pillow Block (24mm Height)', '1602-0032-0004', 'This 4mm bore pillow block consists of a radial bearing press-fit into an aluminum housing. The two legs have M4 x 0.7mm threaded holes, which are spaced 32mm apart and allow you fasten the pillow block to a flat surface while leaving the center of the bearing 24mm above the mounting surface.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/4mm-bore-1-side-2-post-pillow-block-24mm-height/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2374/images/14601/1602-0032-0004__19337__36983.1742419869.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Bearings / 1602 Series 1-Side, 2-Post Pillow Blocks', 'gobilda'),
  ('6mm Bore 1-Side, 2-Post Pillow Block (24mm Height)', '1602-0032-0006', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/6mm-bore-1-side-2-post-pillow-block-24mm-height/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/332/images/2539/1602-0032-0006__66168__51949.1701991622.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Bearings / 1602 Series 1-Side, 2-Post Pillow Blocks', 'gobilda'),
  ('8mm Bore 1-Side, 2-Post Pillow Block (24mm Height)', '1602-0032-0008', 'This 8mm bore pillow block consists of a radial bearing press-fit into an aluminum housing. The two legs have M4 x 0.7mm threaded holes, which are spaced 32mm apart and allow you fasten the pillow block to a flat surface while leaving the center of the bearing 24mm above the mounting surface.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/8mm-bore-1-side-2-post-pillow-block-24mm-height/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/334/images/14614/1602-0032-0008__60456.1742574914.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Bearings / 1602 Series 1-Side, 2-Post Pillow Blocks', 'gobilda'),
  ('12mm Bore 1-Side, 2-Post Pillow Block (24mm Height)', '1602-0032-0012', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/12mm-bore-1-side-2-post-pillow-block-24mm-height/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/336/images/2550/1602-0032-0012__39535__75081.1701991625.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Bearings / 1602 Series 1-Side, 2-Post Pillow Blocks', 'gobilda'),
  ('32mm Bore 1-Side, 2-Post Pillow Block (24mm Height)', '1602-0032-0032', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/32mm-bore-1-side-2-post-pillow-block-24mm-height/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/338/images/2556/1602-0032-0032__29054__73242.1701991627.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Bearings / 1602 Series 1-Side, 2-Post Pillow Blocks', 'gobilda'),
  ('8mm REX® Bore 1-Side, 2-Post Pillow Block (24mm Height)', '1602-0032-4008', 'This 8mm REX® bore pillow block consists of a radial bearing press-fit into an aluminum housing. The two legs have M4 x 0.7mm threaded holes, which are spaced 32mm apart and allow you fasten the pillow block to a flat surface while leaving the center of the bearing 24mm above the mounting surface.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/8mm-rex-bore-1-side-2-post-pillow-block-24mm-height/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2375/images/14610/1602-0032-4008__27350__02248.1742419892.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Bearings / 1602 Series 1-Side, 2-Post Pillow Blocks', 'gobilda'),
  ('1603 Series Face Thru-Hole Pillow Block (3mm Bore)', '1603-0032-0003', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1603-series-face-thru-hole-pillow-block-3mm-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/340/images/2560/1603-0032-0003__79027__02492.1701991628.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('4mm Bore Face Thru-Hole Pillow Block (32mm x 32mm Mounting Pattern)', '1603-0032-0004', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/4mm-bore-face-thru-hole-pillow-block-32mm-x-32mm-mounting-pattern/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/343/images/2569/1603-0032-0004__40700__15975.1701991632.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Bearings / Face Thru-Hole Pillow Blocks', 'gobilda'),
  ('5mm Bore Face Thru-Hole Pillow Block (32mm x 32mm Mounting Pattern)', '1603-0032-0005', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/5mm-bore-face-thru-hole-pillow-block-32mm-x-32mm-mounting-pattern/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/345/images/2574/1603-0032-0005__08914__78395.1701991633.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('6mm Bore Face Thru-Hole Pillow Block (32mm x 32mm Mounting Pattern)', '1603-0032-0006', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/6mm-bore-face-thru-hole-pillow-block-32mm-x-32mm-mounting-pattern/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/347/images/2588/1603-0032-0006__20825__38036.1701991637.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Bearings / Face Thru-Hole Pillow Blocks', 'gobilda'),
  ('8mm Bore Face Thru-Hole Pillow Block (32mm x 32mm Mounting Pattern)', '1603-0032-0008', 'With its arms thrown wide to help to encompass the reach of your creativity, this 8mm Bore Pillow Block possesses a huge range of attachment possibilities across the goBILDA® build system! It owes its versatility to the four thru-holes on the goBILDA® 32mm square pattern, which allow for attachments via M4 hardware to help to support the smooth rotation of 8mm round shafting—as well as goBILDA® signature 8mm REX® shafting!—in your robot or project.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/8mm-bore-face-thru-hole-pillow-block-32mm-x-32mm-mounting-pattern/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/349/images/15918/Ang1__26144.1769791245.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Bearings / Face Thru-Hole Pillow Blocks', 'gobilda'),
  ('10mm Bore Face Thru-Hole Pillow Block (32mm x 32mm Mounting Pattern)', '1603-0032-0010', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/10mm-bore-face-thru-hole-pillow-block-32mm-x-32mm-mounting-pattern/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/351/images/2606/1603-0032-0010__38253__42043.1701991642.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Bearings / Face Thru-Hole Pillow Blocks', 'gobilda'),
  ('1603 Series Face Thru-Hole Pillow Block (12mm Bore)', '1603-0032-0012', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1603-series-face-thru-hole-pillow-block-12mm-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/342/images/2568/1603-0032-0012__49692__05305.1701991631.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Bearings / Face Thru-Hole Pillow Blocks', 'gobilda'),
  ('1603 Series Face Thru-Hole Pillow Block (32mm Bore)', '1603-0032-0032', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1603-series-face-thru-hole-pillow-block-32mm-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/344/images/2573/1603-0032-0032__01096__10773.1701991633.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('8mm REX® Bore Face Thru-Hole Pillow Block (32mm x 32mm Mounting Pattern)', '1603-0032-4008', 'With its arms thrown wide to help to encompass the reach of your creativity, this 8mm REX® Bore Pillow Block possesses a huge range of attachment possibilities across the goBILDA® build system! It owes its versatility to the four thru-holes on the goBILDA® 32mm square pattern, which allow for attachments via M4 hardware to help to support the smooth rotation of the goBILDA® signature 8mm REX® shafting in your robot or project.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/8mm-rex-bore-face-thru-hole-pillow-block-32mm-x-32mm-mounting-pattern/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2504/images/16487/Ang1__31287__46679.1776456284.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Bearings', 'gobilda'),
  ('32mm Bore 2-Side, 2-Post Pillow Block (43mm Width)', '1604-0043-0032', 'Bolster your big tube assemblies with a 32mm ID pillow block! Its threaded holes and 43mm width allow you to tuck it into goBILDA® U-Channel to support 32mm diameter components such as goTUBE, goRAIL®, or Pattern Spacers.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/32mm-bore-2-side-2-post-pillow-block-43mm-width/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/346/images/2583/1604-0043-0032-Rev1__54302__09122.1701991636.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Bearings / Face Thru-Hole Pillow Blocks', 'gobilda'),
  ('4mm Bore 1-Side, 1-Post Pillow Block (24mm Height)', '1605-0024-0004', 'This 4mm Bore Pillow Block has an M4 threaded hole in its base that allows for easy fastening to a flat surface in order to support the smooth rotation of 4mm diameter shafting or an M4 screw in your robot or project. While other styles of goBILDA® pillow blocks provide greater restraint via multiple mounting posts, the single post of a 1-Side, 1-Post Pillow Block allows you to adjust the angle of a shaft and run it at any angle to the X&Y lines of the goBILDA® grid! The center of the bearing…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/4mm-bore-1-side-1-post-pillow-block-24mm-height/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2373/images/14575/1605-0024-0004-Vertical__68071__24525.1741872751.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Bearings / 1605 Series 1-Side, 1-Post Pillow Blocks', 'gobilda'),
  ('6mm Bore 1-Side, 1-Post Pillow Block (24mm Height)', '1605-0024-0006', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/6mm-bore-1-side-1-post-pillow-block-24mm-height/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/348/images/14587/1605-0024-0006__31495__85696__31813.1742393256.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Bearings / 1605 Series 1-Side, 1-Post Pillow Blocks', 'gobilda'),
  ('1605 Series 1-Side, 1-Post Pillow Block (8mm Bore)', '1605-0024-0008', 'This 8mm Bore Pillow Block has an M4 threaded hole in its base that allows for easy fastening to a flat surface in order to support the smooth rotation of 8mm diameter shafting in your robot or project. While other styles of goBILDA® pillow blocks provide greater restraint via multiple mounting posts, the single post of a 1-Side, 1-Post Pillow Block allows you to adjust the angle of a shaft and run it at any angle to the X&Y lines of the goBILDA® grid! The center of the bearing is 24mm from…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1605-series-1-side-1-post-pillow-block-8mm-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/350/images/14588/1605-0024-0008-Vertical_1__56002__46841.1762289668.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Bearings / 1605 Series 1-Side, 1-Post Pillow Blocks', 'gobilda'),
  ('8mm REX® Bore 1-Side, 1-Post Pillow Block (24mm Height)', '1605-0024-4008', 'This 8mm REX® Bore 1-Side, 1-Post Pillow Block has an M4 threaded hole in its base that allows for easy fastening to a flat surface in order to support the smooth rotation of goBILDA® signature positive-drive 8mm REX® profile shafting in your robot or project. While other styles of goBILDA® pillow blocks provide greater restraint via multiple mounting posts, the single post of a 1-Side, 1-Post Pillow Block allows you to adjust the angle of a shaft and run it at any angle to the X&Y lines of…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/8mm-rex-bore-1-side-1-post-pillow-block-24mm-height/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2372/images/14567/1605-0024-4008-Vertical__48542__85220.1741816370.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Bearings / 1605 Series 1-Side, 1-Post Pillow Blocks', 'gobilda'),
  ('4mm Bore 2-Side, 1-Post Pillow Block (43mm Width)', '1606-0043-0004', 'This 4mm Bore 2-Side, 1-Post Pillow Block combines a radial bearing with an aluminum housing that provides for easy fastening to your project. The housing''s 43mm width is a perfect match for the internal width of 1120 Series U-Channel. Since both sides of its post feature an attachment point in line with the bearing, you can attach this pillow block to your assembly at unorthodox angles! Other versatile mounting options are made possible via 4mm thru-holes spaced 32mm apart. You can use them…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/4mm-bore-2-side-1-post-pillow-block-43mm-width/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1945/images/10513/1606-0043-0004-Side2__02531__89880.1701994129.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Bearings / 1606 Series 2-Side, 1-Post Pillow Blocks', 'gobilda'),
  ('6mm Bore 2-Side, 1-Post Pillow Block (43mm Width)', '1606-0043-0006', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/6mm-bore-2-side-1-post-pillow-block-43mm-width/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/353/images/2617/1606-0043-0006__70830__10617.1701991646.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Bearings / 1606 Series 2-Side, 1-Post Pillow Blocks', 'gobilda'),
  ('8mm Bore 2-Side, 1-Post Pillow Block (43mm Width)', '1606-0043-0008', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/8mm-bore-2-side-1-post-pillow-block-43mm-width/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/355/images/2630/1606-0043-0008_Side2__32239__82129.1701991649.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Bearings / 1606 Series 2-Side, 1-Post Pillow Blocks', 'gobilda'),
  ('8mm REX® Bore 2-Side, 1-Post Pillow Block (43mm Width)', '1606-0043-4008', 'This 8mm REX® Bore 2-Side, 1-Post Pillow Block combines a radial bearing with an aluminum housing that provides for easy fastening to your project. The housing''s 43mm width is a perfect match for the internal width of 1120 Series U-Channel. Since both sides of its post feature an attachment point in line with the bearing, you can attach this pillow block to your assembly at unorthodox angles! Other versatile mounting options are made possible via 4mm thru-holes spaced 32mm apart. You can use…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/8mm-rex-bore-2-side-1-post-pillow-block-43mm-width/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1942/images/10502/1606-0043-4008-Side2__79030__07544.1701994127.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Bearings / 1606 Series 2-Side, 1-Post Pillow Blocks', 'gobilda'),
  ('6mm Bore Dual Bearing Idler Roller (15mm OD, 41mm Length)', '1607-0041-0615', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/6mm-bore-dual-bearing-idler-roller-15mm-od-41mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/357/images/2636/1607-0041-0615__47243__21159.1701991651.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Bearings / Idler Bearings', 'gobilda'),
  ('Idler Bearing-Hub (32mm OD, 16mm Height)', '1608-0001-0001', 'The Idler Bearing-Hub is a rotating assembly with parallel mounting surfaces. The thrust bearing ensures smooth action in a situation that applies an axial load while the pair of flanged bearings serve the duty of handling radial load.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/idler-bearing-hub-32mm-od-16mm-height/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1275/images/6323/1608-0001-0001_REV2_Ang1__46171__78657.1701992817.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Bearings / Idler Bearing-Hubs', 'gobilda'),
  ('1609 Series V-Groove Bearing (4mm ID x 10.5mm OD, 6mm Thickness) - 2 Pack', '1609-0610-0004', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1609-series-v-groove-bearing-4mm-id-x-10-5mm-od-6mm-thickness-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1501/images/7661/1609-0610-0004__32226__64088.1701993232.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Linear Motion Guides / V-Guide Based', 'gobilda'),
