  ('1611 Series Flanged Ball Bearing (6mm ID x 14mm OD, 5mm Thickness) - 2 Pack', '1611-0514-0006', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1611-series-flanged-ball-bearing-6mm-id-x-14mm-od-5mm-thickness-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/352/images/2611/1611-0514-0006__43636__53883.1701991644.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Bearings / Flanged Ball Bearings', 'gobilda'),
