  ('6mm D-Shaft (Stainless Steel, 40mm Length)', '2101-0006-0040', 'When coupled to a motor shaft, this 40mm length of D-shaft will reach through 1120 Series U-Channel and protrude out the other side. This protrusion is just long enough to install a bearing, a shaft spacer, and a hub or pinion gear.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2101-series-stainless-steel-d-shaft-6mm-diameter-40mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/413/images/2894/2101-0006-0040__57957__15464.1701991726.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Shafting & Tubing / Stainless Steel D-Shafting', 'gobilda'),
